  "prefLabel": "Agr 908.08 Native Lumber Grading Test",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Agr 908.08 Native Lumber Grading Test.\n\n(a) Testing shall be administered by the university of New Hampshire cooperative extension.\n\n(b) Competency in native lumber grading shall be demonstrated by the prospective grader who can attain a cumulative score of 80% or higher on the exam of which they score 100% on the grading component which distinguishes No. 2 or better grades from lesser grades of native lumber of different softwood species, and of random lengths, widths, and defects.\n\nSource. #6171, eff 1-24-96, EXPIRED: 1-24-04\n\nNew. #14550, eff 4-1-26, EXPIRES: 4-1-36",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/agr900.html"
